# Frontend / template build rules (Mygratr site)

The site is Next.js 16.2.4 + Tailwind v4 + Sanity, on Vercel (root override
`site/`). These patterns were locked in DESIGN-1 + TEMPLATE-BLOG. Honour them.

## Component library is the source of truth
- 22 primitives + Icon system live under `site/src/components/ui/{name}/`.
  COMPONENTS.md is the index; the `index.tsx` source carries the rationale.
  Read COMPONENTS.md before composing a template; do not reinvent a primitive
  that exists.
- Structure vs skin: primitives read colour/type/spacing from tokens. To restyle
  for the new design, change tokens (D2), not the primitive, unless the Figma
  changed the component's actual SHAPE (then it's a tagged shape-edit in D4).
- Layout-root providers: TooltipProvider + ToastProvider must wrap once at
  `site/src/app/layout.tsx` or those primitives break.

## Forms
- react-hook-form + zod. C1/C2/C4 register-based; C3 Select is Controller-based
  (Radix is controlled). C5 FormField is the smart wrapper (auto ids + aria +
  error reading). Use FormField for composed forms; bare register for single
  inputs.

## Sanity data + rendering
- E1 Image takes the Sanity source object; hotspot/crop honoured via
  @sanity/image-url. Never hand-build image URLs. `priority` only on hero/LCP.
- B3 PortableText renders body content. Inline images route through E1. Use the
  override hatch (partial deep-merge) for per-template renderer overrides, do not
  fork B3. `<h3>` renders at size h4 per HALT 4 Decision 6.
- E2 VideoEmbed auto-detects Vimeo / YouTube / LinkedIn (CONTENT-1E added
  LinkedIn). Lite mode needs poster + title; eager needs title only.
- GROQ + Zod per template: project exactly what the template needs, validate the
  shape. TEMPLATE-BLOG is the reference implementation.

## SEO is structural, per template
- One H1, semantic HTML, correct JSON-LD schema.org type, meta from Sanity,
  canonical + locale-correct (US default + `/uk/`). Sitemap entry per locale.
  This is acceptance criteria, not polish.

## Known scaffold gaps (do not be surprised by these)
- Header + Footer chrome land at STATIC-1; templates built before then render
  without nav (Tech Debt #24). Header locked at Path A (no GSAP yet; batched with
  HOME).
- Third-party script budget, cookie hygiene, ClaraChatBot WCAG AA, hero
  aspect-ratio are SCAFFOLD-AUDIT batch (Tech Debt #21-#33), not per-template
  fixes. Log, defer, do not chase mid-template.
- Finsweet `@2` is ESM-only, patched via `type="module"`. env.ts is split
  client/server for primitive-safe public-var import. Don't "tidy" either.

## Visual Editing
Single-client architecture; `defineLive` with viewer-scoped serverToken at
`site/src/lib/sanity/live.ts`. Draft-mode enable route has a six-step security
order with allow-list + Sanity-null-origin escape hatch + secret + same-origin
redirect. Do not loosen the security order to "make preview work".

## UI strings
UI_STRINGS lint rule is live (`react/jsx-no-literals` + local rule). Canonical
SoT at `tools/eslint/ui-strings.json`; generated `site/src/lib/ui-strings.ts` is
do-not-edit (`npm run generate-ui-strings`). Marketing copy comes from Sanity,
not hardcoded JSX.
